{"product_id":"goldy-superhamsterbook-14-books-for-boys","title":"Goldy, Superhamsterbook 14 (Books for Boys)","description":"\u003cp\u003ehi ludo dont be sad im your friend This was my first text message to the boy. Not bad, was it? Not for a hamster. Ludo says I'm a genius, but I know he is as well. We have something else in common, too ...we both want to escape, and to explore the Outside. Just two problems. His parents ...and the cat. Ian Whybrow's BOOKS FOR BOYS are funny, pacy reads from one of the UK's best-loved authors - collect all sixteen!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ian Whybrow\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781444915754\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 64\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45652475084953,"sku":"9RB9781444915754","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68a312f78086d_Goldy__Superhamsterbook_14__Books_for_Boys__Ian_Whybrow.jpg?v=1755526805","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/goldy-superhamsterbook-14-books-for-boys","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}